# Whitelist: only PDFs in the base folder are tracked.
# Everything else (LaTeX sources, build artifacts, compute folders) is ignored.

# Ignore everything
*

# also the working folder for Q3 -(by Ryan)
/bsw-volunteer-dist (2)
# ...except directories, so git can look inside them
!*/

# Allow only PDFs in the base folder
!/*.pdf
!/*.tex
# Allow this file itself
!.gitignore
